message: "If you use HISTOR or its data, please cite the software and the dataset snapshot you used."
type: software
title: "HISTOR — public transparency log of MCP tool definitions"
abstract: "Reads what remote MCP endpoints and npm/PyPI MCP packages advertise, signs each observation as an MTL/1 label, appends it to an RFC 9162 Merkle log and answers /check: is what a client received what was observed? Weekly open-data snapshots with per-change classification."
authors:
